        "thought_text": "Instead of using depth-first search (DFS) to detect cycles, consider using a topological sorting algorithm like Kahn's algorithm. This approach can efficiently detect cycles and find a valid ordering of files if one exists, which aligns with the goal of eliminating cyclic dependencies.",
